# lab_fire9 (Spec 11.34 fire9): fire8 re-tuned against concept D frame 3 - low leaning ring (force .15, r 2.4), scorch lifted to .12 m and
# wider, column on the new puff sheet (soft soot puffs instead of DiscSmoke rectangles). Same five moments, shot + side + fx probe.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.35
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 0.45
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire9_3
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire9_3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.25
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire9_4
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire9_4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.40
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire9_5
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire9_5
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 1.0
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire9_6
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire9_6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 1.5
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire9_7
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire9_7
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run report
mem
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
